A test harness for AIeConA HR. It emulates a synthetic customer relationship management system and
generates SYNTHETIC records only.

EVERY RECORD THIS SOFTWARE PRODUCES IS FABRICATED.

No record originates from a real person, a real organisation, or any real
system. Every record is stamped with a refusal marker so that the product it
tests will reject it on sight if it ever reaches a production ingestion path.
That refusal is a safety control, not a convention: see contract/markers.py in
the AIeConA adapter contract, and the separation gates in the product.

This software must not be used to populate, seed or demonstrate any live HR,
payroll or workforce system. It is provided to make one claim checkable — that
AIeConA HR is tested against generated data and never against real employee
records.

